<!-- RegionOverlayWindow.xaml — No longer used for visual rendering.

The overlay now uses a raw Win32 transparent window (WS_EX_LAYERED) to
show the live desktop through it. This XAML file is kept for the Window
subclass requirement but the visual tree is not rendered — all drawing
happens via GDI on the Win32 layered window.

The Window is invisible and never shown to the user.
-->
<Window
    x:Class="captcho.UI.RegionOverlayWindow"
    xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">

    <Canvas x:Name="RootCanvas"
            Background="Transparent"/>

</Window>
